D. Evidence-Based Defence – 2 Marks
The modified design is more flexible and maintainable.
Evaluation	Result
Existing classes modified	Mainly ParkingFacility and pricing/ticket handling
New vehicle types	Added using EBike and DeliveryVan subclasses
Future vehicle addition	Can be added through another subclass and pricing rule
Different floor sizes	Supported using jagged arrays
One-day pass	Implemented using Pass interface
Pricing management	Centralized in ParkingPricing
Test Results:
