E-Bike flat fee	₹20	₹20
Delivery Van – 2 hours at 10 AM	₹120	₹120
One-day pass	₹100	₹100
Five floors	5	5
Trade-offs:
•	A separate pricing class makes the system easier to maintain, but introduces an additional class.
•	A jagged array supports different floor sizes, but requires checking each floor separately.
•	Adding new subclasses reduces changes to existing vehicle classes, but new pricing rules must also be defined.

